<title>JAPAN: Bandai - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Bandai - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 42.08		vs	   54.32</p>
<p> Operating	  865 million	 vs	    3.62</p>
<p> Current		1.82		vs	    4.27</p>
<p> Net		    1.32		vs	    2.21</p>
<p> EPS		   28.40 yen	  vs	   48.25 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     46 million	  vs	  46 million</p>
<p> Interim div	 10.00 yen	  vs	   10.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Bandai Co Ltd is a leading toy manufacturer.</p>
